+(`grid_h`, `grid_w`, `active_rows`); unknown overrides are rejected and degenerate
+textures cannot masquerade as exact-axis draws. Tests bind the mirror to every labeled
+canonical pair, preserve the original shortcut counterexample, probe all three axis
+extremes, and check 120 helpful draws against every declared rival.
